"settings.tab.help" = "Help";
"settings.help.howTitle" = "How Tippi works";
"settings.help.howBody" = "Select text in any app, then press your hotkey (default ⌥⌘T). A popup appears near your cursor — pick a prompt, preview the result, and replace or copy.";
"settings.help.promptsTitle" = "Custom prompts";
"settings.help.promptsBody" = "Go to the Prompts tab to add your own. Each prompt needs a title, an SF Symbol name, and an instruction for the AI. The selected text is sent automatically — no placeholder needed.";
"settings.help.localActionsTitle" = "Local quick actions";
"settings.help.localActionsBody" = "Tippi is not PopClip: marking text alone does not open the menu. Select text, then press your hotkey (default ⌥⌘T) or choose Trigger Tippi… from the menu bar.\n\nWhen text is captured, Quick actions appear above the AI prompts. They run locally: rich-text formatting, case changes, underscore/hyphen, brackets, join lines, and counts.\n\nBold/Italic/Underline/Strike use RTF when the app supports it; plain-text apps get Markdown-style fallbacks (**bold**, ~~struck~~). Counts only show a number and do not edit text.\n\nIf you see “No text captured”, grant Accessibility for the Tippi.app you launched (local test builds need a fresh toggle after each make build). TextEdit and Notes work best. Hide Quick actions in Settings → General.";
"settings.help.troubleBody" = "Nothing happens when you only highlight text? Press ⌥⌘T (or ⌃⌥⌘T) after selecting — Tippi does not auto-open like PopClip.\n\nHotkey not firing? Grant Accessibility (System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility). Trigger via menu bar ✏️ → Trigger Tippi…\n\nQuick actions show but text does not change? Re-select text in TextEdit/Notes, trigger again, then tap the action. Local builds: enable Accessibility for build/Build/Products/Release/Tippi.app and restart the app.\n\nNew hotkey not responding? Quit and reopen Tippi.";
"settings.help.variablesTitle" = "Prompt variables";
"settings.help.variablesBody" = "Use {placeholders} in your prompt instructions — Tippi fills them in at trigger time:\n\n{clipboard} — your current clipboard content\n{app_name} — the app you're writing in (e.g. Mail, Safari, Slack)\n{language} — detected language of your selected text (e.g. German)\n{selected_text} — the selected text itself\n\nExample — app-aware tone:\n\"Rewrite for {app_name}. In Slack: casual, max 2 sentences. In Mail: formal.\"\n\nExample — clipboard as style reference (copy a sample text first):\n\"Match the tone of this reference: {clipboard}\"\n\nExample — always stay in the right language:\n\"Improve the text. Stay in {language}. Return only the result.\"";
"settings.help.importExportTitle" = "Share & import prompts";
"settings.help.importExportBody" = "Export your custom prompts as a .tippipack file to share them with teammates or keep a backup.\n\nExport all — click \"Export All\" at the top of the Prompts tab.\nExport one — click the ↑ icon next to any prompt.\nImport — click \"Import\", select a .tippipack file, then choose Merge (keeps your existing prompts) or Replace (replaces them).\n\nImported prompts always get fresh IDs, so they never conflict with existing ones.";
"settings.help.apiTitle" = "AI providers & keys";
"settings.help.apiBody" = "Add your API key in the Providers tab. Tippi supports 8 providers — OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Mistral, Scaleway (EU, Paris) and Groq (cloud, BYOK), plus Ollama and MLX (both fully local, free, no key needed). Keys are stored securely in the macOS Keychain.";

"settings.help.linksTitle" = "Links & resources";
"settings.help.linksBody" = "[GitHub repository](https://github.com/miwixyz/Tippi) — public, MIT-licensed, source code, issues, releases.\n\n[Landing page](https://miwixyz.github.io/Tippi/) — bilingual EN/DE, features, screenshots, download.\n\n[One-pager](https://github.com/miwixyz/Tippi/blob/main/docs/ONE-PAGER.md) — for Hacker News, Reddit, sharing with friends; what Tippi is in 60 seconds.\n\n[Changelog](https://github.com/miwixyz/Tippi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) — every change, every version.\n\n[Latest release](https://github.com/miwixyz/Tippi/releases/latest) — DMG download, release notes, checksums.";

